# Cabbie v2.0
# (C) 2010-2026 The Authors (see /rockbox/wps/AUTHORS)
# Derived from "Cabbie v2.0" (C) 2010-2012 The Authors
#
# The YP3's FM screen (128x160) in the style of its Now Playing
# (cabbiev2.128x160x16.yp3.wps): the YP3 loads no backdrops, so the header
# bar and the bar's track are viewport colours, and there are no images.
# The status bar stays (battery, volume, clock).
#
# Header
%V(7,15,114,12,1)%Vb(f0c122)%Vf(000000)
%ac%Sx(FM Radio)
#
# Frequency, and the preset's name when tuned to one
%V(0,31,-,24,1)
%ac%tf MHz
%s%ac%?Ti<%Ti. %?Tn<%Tn|%Tf>|>
#
# Where the frequency sits in the band, on the track's grey
%V(8,59,112,8,1)%Vb(5f5f5f)%Vf(f0c122)
%pb(0,0,112,8,noborder)
#
# Mode and stereo, signal strength
%V(8,70,112,24,1)
%al%?tm<%Sx(Scan)|%Sx(Preset)>%ar%?St(force fm mono)<%Sx(Force Mono)|%?ts<%Sx(Stereo)|%Sx(Mono)>>
%ac%tr dBuV
#
# RDS: call letters and name; programme type; RT+ artist and title, else
# the RadioText (as the built-in screen)
%V(0,100,-,48,1)
%s%ac%?tc<%tc  |>%ty
%s%ac%tg
%?ti<%s%ac%tw|%s%ac%tz>
%?ti<%s%ac%ti|>
